    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 38,
      "topLeftY": 198,
      "bottomRightX": 464,
      "bottomRightY": 244,
      "content": "$$\\frac{1}{h} \\oint (p_1 dy^1 + p_2 dy^2) = \\frac{1}{h} \\oint \\frac{m_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\eta^2 \\beta^2}} (v dt - \\omega R v dt)$$",
